 "note": "    uv run python tools/e1v2_posthoc.py        # after `dsoi-e1v2 score` The pre-registered calibrated arm (src/dsoi/experiments/e1v2_score.py) pins the pipeline to the model's interpreter version, but `widen` labels each widened reading with \"+cal<q>\", so whenever q > 0 L1's version check rejects every widened reply and the arm decides on the stale nominal state (data/e1v2/DEVIATIONS.md, item 2). That arm is reported as frozen. This script runs the arm the protocol describes: the same replies, the same margin q from results/e1v2/summary.json, the same box-robust gate, with the pipeline pinned to the widened label.",
